{
  "info": {
    "name": "Coral — Uber Eats Sandbox",
    "description": "Uber Eats sandbox testing for Coral. Source: https://developer.uber.com/docs/eats/guides/sandbox . Includes every outbound operation shown in that guide plus detailed-reference alternatives for stores, menus and order lifecycle. Guide variants are explicitly labeled because their routes differ from detailed references. Enter credentials privately in Postman. Run token first; then select requests individually, not the whole collection: online/pause and accept/deny/cancel are alternative state transitions. Set store_id and order_id from Uber-provided test data. Sandbox support can depend on provisioning and scopes; a 404 on a guide variant does not establish that a canonical route works. Webhook receipt requires a running receiver and a test order placed through Uber; this collection does not manufacture Uber orders or send fake notifications to Coral.",
